Automated Drupal 11 compatibility fixes for fieldable_path

See https://www.drupal.org/i/3430541 and
https://git.drupalcode.org/project/fieldable_path/-/merge_requests/4
(merge request open, not yet released; drupal/fieldable_path is at
1.0.0 with no newer stable release, and has no code actually
incompatible with Drupal 11 per drupal/upgrade_status - only the
core_version_requirement string and one hook_module_implements_alter()
call needed updating).

--- a/fieldable_path.info.yml
+++ b/fieldable_path.info.yml
@@ -2,7 +2,7 @@ name: Fieldable Path
 description: Provides a fieldable mirror of "path" property for entities.

 type: module
-core_version_requirement: ^9.1 || ^10
+core_version_requirement: ^9.1 || ^10 || ^11

 dependencies:
   - drupal:path
--- a/fieldable_path.module
+++ b/fieldable_path.module
@@ -43,7 +43,7 @@ function fieldable_path_module_implements_alter(&$implementations, $hook) {
   // to control path alias creation. In some cases, when this module calls
   // entity save on path change outside of entity form, we do not want
   // to let pathauto to create a new path alias and override the correct value.
-  if (\Drupal::service('module_handler')->moduleExists('pathauto')) {
+  if (isset($implementations['pathauto'])) {
     unset($implementations['pathauto']);
   }
 }
